## Outcome

Freeze and implement the smallest complete pre-PRM readiness substrate: exact trigger and freshness
semantics, versioned structured result records, current/stale lookup, fail-closed mutation, distinct
semantic versus operational outcomes, and generated read-only presentation.

## Scope

- Add the approved contract as settled product documentation.
- Reuse the append-only managed Hybrid event primitive as the structured authority unless evidence
  proves it insufficient.
- Add prepare, validate, apply, status, and exact gate-transfer commands.
- Bind every result to Idea artifact UUID, visible ID, document revision/body hash, and contract
  version.
- Reject stale Idea writes and unknown contracts before persistence or promotion reuse.
- Add focused tests for the M1 failure, concurrency, authority, and projection gates.

## Non-Goals

- Do not add a new database schema or editable Markdown review artifact.
- Do not integrate natural-language Tool Shed routes until M2.
- Do not release or synchronize the installed skill until M3.

